import ../../helpers/driver.dl

appearance editor appearance:
    padding is 12
    font size is 16
    height is 100
    lines do not wrap

document editor test:
    editor "Program" containing "Aé🙂B\nC" using editor appearance

set instance to an instance of editor test
set view to a UI view of (the address of instance) sized 300 by 200 using font "regular" with the test UI driver
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 3 key 258 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set source to view's selection's caret source
require condition (source's text = "Aé🙂B\nC") reporting "Tab did not focus the editor"
queue UI input of kind 3 key 268 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (view's selection's caret = 9) reporting "Home did not move to the logical line start"
queue UI input of kind 3 key 265 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (view's selection's caret = 0) reporting "Up did not preserve the visual column"
queue UI input of kind 3 key 269 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 2 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 3 key 257 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 3 key 258 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (source's text = "Aé🙂B\nC\n    ") reporting "Multiline insertion or indentation failed"
queue UI input of kind 3 key 90 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 2 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (source's text = "Aé🙂B\nC\n") reporting "Undo did not restore the previous source"
queue UI input of kind 3 key 90 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 2 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (source's text = "Aé🙂B\nC") reporting "Undo did not retain the full edit history"
queue UI input of kind 3 key 89 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 2 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (source's text = "Aé🙂B\nC\n") reporting "Redo did not restore the edit"
queue UI input of kind 4 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "tail" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 3 key 268 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((view's selection's caret = 11) and (source's text = "Aé🙂B\nC\ntail")) reporting "Queued navigation used geometry from before the edit"
queue UI input of kind 1 key 0 at 12.0 20.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 2 key 1 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 2 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 4 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "Z" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition view's keyboard focus reporting "The editor caret lost focus after a pointer click"
require condition (source's text = "ZAé🙂B\nC\ntail") reporting "Clicking the editor did not retain editing focus"
close the address of view
close the address of instance
print line "Multiline editing, visual navigation, indentation and undo work."
